{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026hR2RzUbEGI1794312147.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>Google指控深圳一間電子廠，在130萬部安卓電視機頂盒中，植入後門，形成殭屍網絡。</p><p></p><p>Google稱，曾獲得安卓TV合作夥伴認證的深圳視壯科技，在130萬台安卓電視機頂盒中，植入後門。攻擊者可透過後門，安裝隱藏軟件，進行廣告欺詐或安裝惡意軟件，甚至可以直接攻擊終端用戶。連接安卓網絡的其他電子設備，同樣會受到影響。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.GOOGLE-2000-1_CLEAN_20261110_203106_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026ivMSB3dqV71794314391.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>Google指，已聯同日本警察廳及相關資訊公司，聯手拆除後門及受感染的網絡，並取消與視壯科技的合作。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T13:32:30.368973+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":209,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T11:29:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T18:18:34.370413+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T13:25:54.076078+00:00","content_hash":"9cfc90b7b9145f0980c29e41092cef9cc875fe2d3f85f38a84b781c7a164fe55","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}